# The part of Sodium UI that Sodium Remote's app uses, by path under SodiumOS's ui/ (and the same path under sodium-ui/).
# Written by hand from the QML import closure of app/qml (see tools/sync-sodium-ui.py); tools/sync-sodium-ui.py copies it one way.
#   copy PATH            copied byte for byte from SodiumOS's ui/PATH
#   derived PATH FROM    ours: trimmed from ui/FROM (default: the same path). The sync never writes it; it warns when ui/FROM changed since UPSTREAM
#                        recorded the hash it was derived from.
#
# QML closure (39 files, with motion.js and popup.js)
